597 - Ye Servants of the Lord
 / 
Key: C
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 597
Topic: Christian Life - 

Verse 1:
[G/B]Ye [C]servants of [G]the Lord,
[G/B]Each [C]in [G7/D]his [C/E]office wait,
[F]Observant of [G]His [G7/F]heavenly [G/B]Word,
[G7/D]And [C]watchful at [G]His [G7]gate.

Verse 2:
[G/B]Let [C]all your lamps [G]be bright,
[G/B]And [C]trim [G7/D]the [C/E]golden flame,
[F]Gird [Dm]up [F]your loins [G]as [G7/F]in [C/E]His sight,
[G7/D]His [C]coming thus [G]proclaim.

Verse 3:
[G/B]Watch, [C]'tis your Lord's [G]command,
[G/B]And [C]while we speak He's [F]near;
